# Everything in this repo runs offline with no API keys: the Expression Translator falls back to a
# deterministic stub that understands a fixed set of demo questions. Copy this file to `.env` only if
# you want the app, `npm run eval`, and `npm run trace:demo` to use a real model.

# --- Model access (provider-agnostic) ----------------------------------------------------------
# Any provider that exposes an OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions endpoint works, including hosted
# providers and local runtimes. Check your provider's docs for its compatible base URL.
#
#   AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
#   AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1          # e.g. Ollama: fully local, no key needed
#
# AI_BASE_URL=
# AI_API_KEY=

# Prompts declare a *tier* (prompts/*.md -> model_routing.tier), never a vendor model.
# Map each tier to a model id offered by your provider:
# AI_MODEL_LIGHTWEIGHT=

# Force the offline stub even when the variables above are set (used by tests and `eval:deterministic`).
# AI_FORCE_STUB=1

# --- Observability -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: send OpenTelemetry spans to an OTLP HTTP collector instead of local traces/runs.jsonl
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318/v1/traces
